{"game": "risk-of-rain-returns", "language": "english", "appid": 1337520, "month": "2024-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1709856000, "end_date": 1710547199, "month_true_total": 236, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 00:52:13 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "160622010", "author": {"steamid": "76561199071138084", "personaname": "Hearts", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199071138084/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 624, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 447, "last_played": 1736037593, "avatar": "9addacfaca3e731004a903489e2dac929d6ce05c"}, "language": "english", "review": "UGH IM SO MAD\n\n-buy game\n-open game\n-play tutorial and a run\n-its a little laggy, but i dont mind.\n-lose run on stage one cuz i suck\n-play game next day\n-look at character screen, notice acrid (my main in ror2)\n-get excited\n-spend countless hours searching for him\n-find him on an innocent friday\n-fight him (wuh oh jumpscare)\n-get him to ten hp\n-game freezes\n-start getting concerned\n-steam achievement w/ character unlock  tip pops up\n-celebrate\n-GAME.\n-CRASHES.\n-boot up game\n...\n-i.did.not.unlock.acrid.\n-weep for forty seconds and head straight to steam reviews to complain", "timestamp_created": 1710545115, "timestamp_updated": 1710545115, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.450081825256347656", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160621767", "author": {"steamid": "76561198825209585", "personaname": "Kryptik", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198825209585/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 1680, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_re